		<td width="150" align="left" valign="top" class="row2"><span class="name"><a name="1044"></a><b>meneltel</b></span><br /><span class="postdetails">Praefectus Castrorum<br /><br /><br />Joined: 02 Mar 2003<br />Posts: 157<br /></span><br /></td>
		<td class="row2" width="100%" height="28" valign="top"><table width="100%" border="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0">
			<tr>
				<td width="100%"><a href="viewtopic.php?p=1044&amp;sid=b16eca86cb9e28f404298759615589f6#1044"><img src="templates/smartDark/images/icon_minipost.gif" width="12" height="9" alt="Post" title="Post" border="0" /></a><span class="postdetails">Posted: Mon Jun 30, 2003 11:33 pm<span class="gen">&nbsp;</span>&nbsp; &nbsp;Post subject: </span></td>
				<td valign="top" nowrap="nowrap"><a href="posting.php?mode=quote&amp;p=1044&amp;sid=b16eca86cb9e28f404298759615589f6"><img src="templates/smartDark/images/lang_english/icon_quote.gif" alt="Reply with quote" title="Reply with quote" border="0" /></a>   </td>
			</tr>
			<tr>
				<td colspan="2"><hr /></td>
			</tr>
			<tr>
				<td colspan="2"><span class="postbody">The assembled force from Dark Inheritance did its work quickly and with all the skill at their disposal. It was led by Meneltel Tormtor, a Shadowknight and the Battlemistress of Domus Noctis and she was accompanied by Ooze, a fellow Shadowknight; and by Dariana, a Druidess and second to Domus Solis and by Thbon, a Dwarven Warrior of some renown also of Solis and by Sir Llainn, a Paladin of Tunare and Solis.  They had gathered to storm Najena's home and recover a lost lock of hair reportedly stolen by Najena and take for unknown but suspected dark reasons.
<br />
     The group was succesful in reaching Najena's lair and to her secured room but neither the lock or Najena were present.  So the group left but as the guards of Najena sighed in relief as the raiders left, they didnt notice that though 5 had come in, only 4 left......
<br />
      Najena after settling back in her home after being told the raiders had left, was very surprised when a fem Dark Elf shadowknight appeared behind her unannounced except for the glowing hand that touched Najena so painfully, "Where is the lock of hair you stole from me?" asked Meneltel angrily. "Where is it? You will tell me before you die.....and then you will tell me after you die.  And you will repeat it for all time to everyone who asks you why you are working in the Maiden's Fancy."
<br />
     Najena knew that her connections, though strong, would not save her now.  Even the Warriors guild could not save her, nor the Mages of the Spurned.  And so, Najena began to talk about the lock of hair and who she had sold it to.........<br />_________________<br />Don't fear the darkness, fear what is hidden in the darkness.............                    For your suffering will be legendary........even in Hell</span><span class="gensmall"></span></td>
			</tr>
