		<td width="150" align="left" valign="top" class="row1"><span class="name"><a name="1045"></a><b>meneltel</b></span><br /><span class="postdetails">Praefectus Castrorum<br /><br /><br />Joined: 02 Mar 2003<br />Posts: 157<br /></span><br /></td>
		<td class="row1" width="100%" height="28" valign="top"><table width="100%" border="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0">
			<tr>
				<td width="100%"><a href="viewtopic.php?p=1045&amp;sid=b16eca86cb9e28f404298759615589f6#1045"><img src="templates/smartDark/images/icon_minipost.gif" width="12" height="9" alt="Post" title="Post" border="0" /></a><span class="postdetails">Posted: Wed Jul 02, 2003 4:36 pm<span class="gen">&nbsp;</span>&nbsp; &nbsp;Post subject: </span></td>
				<td valign="top" nowrap="nowrap"><a href="posting.php?mode=quote&amp;p=1045&amp;sid=b16eca86cb9e28f404298759615589f6"><img src="templates/smartDark/images/lang_english/icon_quote.gif" alt="Reply with quote" title="Reply with quote" border="0" /></a>   </td>
			</tr>
			<tr>
				<td colspan="2"><hr /></td>
			</tr>
			<tr>
				<td colspan="2"><span class="postbody">Meneltel sat at her desk fuming as she read the missive from Guildmistress Camia V'Retta, head of the Spurned in Neriak.  It was another of several requests that Najena be set free and allowed to return to her home in Lavastorm region.  The requests came from the Spurned, the Indigo Brotherhood, of all groups the most odd and also from Queen Cristanos Thex who has always protected Najena.
<br />
      "Who would have thought that she had so many factions concerned with her?  What is she doing that all of them want her to be allowed to leave in peace?" wondered Meneltel.  "Something to think about in the days ahead," she thought.  "But at least, since I agreed to let Najena live in peace and Najena is NOT allowed to strike back and she agreed to talk so she could leave in peace, I did achieve my goals....." Meneltel smiled.  
<br />
     And so Meneltel began her report to the guild for their quest for the lock of hair was not yet complete.......<br />_________________<br />Don't fear the darkness, fear what is hidden in the darkness.............                    For your suffering will be legendary........even in Hell</span><span class="gensmall"></span></td>
			</tr>
